{"source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "hash": "774d805dc330f15168ea0513fb7fccfb055d181b691f74249a6376ec78762dc1", "nodes": [{"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_doc", "label": "State doc 2026-06-25: v3 vector arm + RAGAS-only eval, k-vs-top-k, k=50/gold-100, structured generator, NIM throttle run ops", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_ragas_only_no_herb_scorer", "label": "SCORING IS RAGAS ONLY: there is no HERB scorer; eval/herb.py was deleted and the old HERB+RAGAS / two-way / HERB-anchor framing is dead and purged (supersedes the 2026-06-18 scoring framing)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_k_is_global_ceiling", "label": "k = the global CEILING: one fixed number identical for every arm, chosen for experiment feasibility, the controlled variable and the -k CLI flag (currently 50) — the most an arm may retrieve and feed the generator", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_topk_is_per_arm_actual_return", "label": "top-k = each arm's ACTUAL return under the ceiling (per-arm, ≤ k), the measured thing read off via the arm's token cost; collapsing k and top-k into one global k is the cardinal sin of this session", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_baselines_topk_equals_k", "label": "Both baselines (lucene, vector) are single-stage no-rerank so top-k = k always; their differentiation is token cost from content size, not count", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_relevant_k_retrieved_k_reference_only", "label": "relevant-k (~5, LangChain 4 / LlamaIndex 2) and retrieved-k (~50, MS MARCO top-1000 rerank pool) are literature reference baselines only, not knobs in this harness (no reranker), never conflated with k or top-k", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_no_ragas_cutoff_param", "label": "RAGAS has no @k/cutoff parameter: context-precision is internally a mean of Precision@k over the retrieved list, so to score at a depth you truncate the retrieved list and re-score; free id-based metrics make the depth curve cheap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_four_judged_metrics", "label": "The 4 judged RAGAS metrics: answer_correctness, faithfulness, context_precision (with-reference = context_precision_llm_ref), context_recall (LLMContextRecall = context_recall_llm), plus the free deterministic ones", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_answer_correctness_added", "label": "answer_correctness was missing from ragas_catalog (which claimed to be complete) and was added to the import, _REGISTRY (needs LLM + embeddings) and CATALOG; audit confirmed it was the only genuinely missing metric", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_k_50_gold100", "label": "k=50 over gold-100 (not the full 1514) is the chosen run: 50 justified by HERB's median 52 citations, recall-meaningful and feasible, and you can truncate stored top-50 to any smaller eval depth (run high, limit later, never higher)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_herb_citation_distribution", "label": "HERB citation distribution over 815 answerable: min 11, median 52, mean 71, p90 170, p99 298, max 683 — so at k=10 zero questions reach full citation recall; recall@k is structurally capped by HERB, reported honestly, equal across arms for fairness", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_structured_output_generator", "label": "The shared generator (orchestrator.build_shared_generator) = Mistral Large 3 on NIM at temperature 0 using OpenAI structured output (response_format json_schema, _ANSWER_SCHEMA {answer:string}), parsing json.loads(content)['answer'] and raising per-question on a non-str; only the answer is the model's job", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_vector_embedder_nemotron", "label": "The vector arm uses nvidia/llama-nemotron-embed-1b-v2 (not all-MiniLM): the references use strong retrieval-tuned embedders, all-MiniLM is English-only + 256-token and cannot fit HERB docs or the deferred Swedish Bonnier set", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_nim_even_pacing", "label": "nim.py transport adds an even-pacing floor _MIN_INTERVAL_S (default 2.0s, env NIM_MIN_INTERVAL_S) on top of the sliding-window cap (RATE_LIMIT_PER_MIN=38) to kill the opening burst; retries 408/429/5xx (6 tries / 300s deadline), raises on other 4xx and on retry exhaustion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_nim_429_burst_hypothesis", "label": "HYPOTHESIS (likely): the NIM 429s are burst-triggered throttling not quota (fast ~14 questions then pegged ~30s/q, token-bucket signature; tiny + 40k-token probes succeeded right after) — confirm by restarting with 2s pacing, else raise NIM_MIN_INTERVAL_S", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_no_eval_parallelism_on_rate_ceiling", "label": "UNCERTAIN whether parallelizing helps: if 429s are a rate ceiling concurrency makes it worse; eval concurrency is not built (only generation has --workers) — do not throw parallelism at a rate ceiling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_per_question_resumable", "label": "Run flow (run.py → orchestrator.run): generate all chosen questions resumably per-question via arm_outputs.jsonl + _done_ids, then RAGAS-score the full set; eval write is per-question append+flush with torn-write recovery, --no-eval = gen only, --build = build+cache index and exit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_press_q_abort_no_prompt", "label": "Press q to abort a run gracefully (abort.py, Windows msvcrt, watch()/aborted()); the blocking y/N pre-run confirmation prompt was removed in favor of mid-run abort", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_circuit_breaker", "label": "Generation circuit breaker aborts after MAX_CONSECUTIVE_FAILURES (default 10) consecutive failures ('backend likely down') — this is what stopped the throttled run at q24", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_embed_cache", "label": "Vector embedding cache: output/embed_cache/llama-nemotron-embed-1b-v2_<hash>.npz (~328 MB, gitignored) + readable <hash>.cost.json, built once (38,540 artifacts, 19 batched calls, ~206s, ~2.72M tokens); EMBED_BATCH raised 64→2048 with split-on-413 recursion and content-addressed atomic write", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_ragas_catalog_structure", "label": "eval/ragas_catalog.py is canonical: CATALOG (37 metrics), ALWAYS (11 free deterministic always-run), SELECTED (judged opt-ins), metrics_to_run() = ALWAYS + SELECTED = 15 now", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_lucene_deterministic_no_cache", "label": "Lucene confirmed: real BM25 over 38,540 docs, deterministic (Porter2/Snowball, no model), needs no cache; its BuildStats is 0-model-cost at ~3.9s", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_arms_share_corpus_and_generator", "label": "3 arms — artefact (SUT, retrieval graph unbuilt), lucene (BM25 built), vector (dense, index cached) — share ONLY the corpus on disk + the injected generator; each has its own retrieval code", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_no_production_rag_framing", "label": "REJECTED: importing a production-RAG / answer-quality-tuning frame (lost-in-the-middle, optimal-k, reranking pools, 'what production feeds the LLM', presupposed reranker) to argue down the design — this is a controlled eval-cutoff comparison, not a product to tune", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_words_are_canon", "label": "User's words are the canon: when the user defines the experiment that IS the spec; never 'correct' it with references, production-RAG norms, or training pattern-matching", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_immediate_next_task", "label": "Immediate next task: get the gold-100 vector run + RAGAS eval to complete past the NIM throttle — resume run.py --arm vector --set gold -k 50 --out output/vector__gold100__20260625T005804Z with 2s pacing, raise NIM_MIN_INTERVAL_S if still throttled", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_ragas_canonical_sources", "label": "For any RAGAS question consult canonical sources — EACL 2024 paper arXiv:2309.15217 + docs.ragas.io, not blogs/memory; references are written into lucene.py, vector.py, eval/ragas.py so the user stops re-supplying them", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_supersedes_2026_06_18", "label": "Supersedes the 2026-06-18 v3 eval-harness state doc on scoring: that doc's HERB+RAGAS / RAGAS-primary-HERB-anchor / both-scorers framing predates the RAGAS-only and k/top-k decisions and is treated as partially outdated", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-v3-vector-eval-k-vs-topk-ragas-ops.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_ragas_only_no_herb_scorer", "target": "2026_06_25_v3_vector_eval_doc", "relation": "references",